classDiagram
direction LR
class InventoryService {
  +adjust(recordId, delta, reason, source) InventoryRecord
  +create(itemId, slotId, quantity, receivedDate, expirationDate, reason) InventoryRecord
  +getAvailable(itemId) int
  +sumReserved(recordId) int
  +findPickableRecords(itemId) List~InventoryRecord~
}
class InventoryRecord {
  +String inventoryRecordId
  +String itemId
  +String slotId
  +int quantityOnHand
  +Date receivedDate
  +Date expirationDate
  +boolean isActive
  +int version
}
class InventoryChange {
  +String employeeId
  +Instant changedAt
  +int oldQuantity
  +int newQuantity
  +String reason
  +String sourceFeature
}
class SlotService {
  +setSlotStatus(slotId, status)
}
class AuditLog {
  +append(entry)
}
class InventoryRepository {
  +lockById(recordId) InventoryRecord
  +save(record)
}
InventoryService --> InventoryRepository : uses
InventoryService --> SlotService : same transaction
InventoryService --> AuditLog : same transaction
InventoryService ..> InventoryRecord : changes
InventoryRecord "1" --> "*" InventoryChange : history
